                      "context": "h2 ← blockContent h2 style, display 30",
                      "fill": "$a-ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "What I learned shipping this",
                      "lineHeight": 1.15,
                      "fontFamily": "$af-display",
                      "fontSize": 30,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "HyaWE",
                      "context": "p ← blockContent normal block, 17/1.65 $a-ink",
                      "fill": "$a-ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "We retired three custom loaders and shipped one component to every surface in the product. Nothing else changed — same data, same network, same code paths. Page-perceived performance improved across the board, but more interestingly, support tickets around 'did my action save?' dropped to almost nothing. The page wasn't faster. It just felt honest.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$af-ui",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "NxTWX",
                      "context": "p ← blockContent normal block, 17/1.65 $a-ink",
                      "fill": "$a-ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "If your design system doesn't have an opinion about loading, your user is the one who has to make one up. That is the part you can fix.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$af-ui",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
